>
<main>
<section class="hero">
<div class="container hero-grid">
<div>
<div class="eyebrow"><h4>Technology advisory &amp; managed services</h4></div>
<h1>Technology support, strategy, and security built around your business.</h1>
<p>Bleufoot Solutions helps growing organizations plan, secure, manage, and modernize their technology with practical consulting, proactive support, and engineering-focused service.</p>
<div class="hero-actions">
<a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quote-request">Schedule a Technology Review →</a>
<a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/services">Explore Services</a>
