<div class="card problem-card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v6l4 2"></path></svg></span><h4>Unreliable Systems</h4><p>Downtime and slow performance impact productivity and customer experience.</p></div>
