<div class="card problem-card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="6" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="4"></rect><rect height="6" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="14"></rect><path d="M7 7h.01M7 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h4>Aging Infrastructure</h4><p>Old hardware and unsupported software increase risk and limit growth.</p></div>
