<div class="card problem-card"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M10.8 7.2L6.2 16.8M13.2 7.2l4.6 9.6M7.5 19h9"></path></svg></span><h4>Vendor Chaos</h4><p>Too many vendors and no coordination lead to gaps, delays, and finger pointing.</p></div>
