<a class="card service-card" href="/managed-services"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M4 13a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"></path><path d="M5 13h3v6H5zM16 13h3v6h-3z"></path><path d="M16 19a4 4 0 0 1-4 2"></path></svg></span><h3>Support</h3><p><strong>Managed IT Services</strong></p><p>Proactive monitoring, help desk, endpoint management, and day-to-day support.</p><span class="learn">Learn More →</span></a>
