<a class="card service-card" href="/network-services"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="12" cy="5" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="5" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><circle cx="19" cy="19" r="2.5"></circle><path d="M10.8 7.2L6.2 16.8M13.2 7.2l4.6 9.6M7.5 19h9"></path></svg></span><h3>Connect</h3><p><strong>Network Solutions</strong></p><p>Firewalls, switching, Wi‑Fi, VPN, cabling, and network monitoring built for reliability.</p><span class="learn">Learn More →</span></a>
<a class="card service-card" href="/cybersecurity"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Protect</h3><p><strong>Cybersecurity</strong></p><p>Security assessments, endpoint protection, MFA, backups, and incident readiness.</p><span class="learn">Learn More →</span></a>
