<div class="process-step"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><h4>Secure</h4><p>We strengthen identity, endpoints, networks, cloud services, backups, and access controls.</p></div>
