<div class="value-panel" style="color:#fff;">
<div class="panel" style="background:linear-gradient(145deg,#06192d,#0a2e55);"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M21 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></span><h3>Business-aligned strategy</h3><p>Technology decisions should be guided by the way your organization actually works.</p></div>
