<div class="panel" style="background:linear-gradient(145deg,#06192d,#0a2e55);"><span class="icon-badge"><svg fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.8" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-5"></path></svg></span><h3>Security built in</h3><p>Every support decision affects access, identity, devices, backups, and risk.</p></div>
